---
// Act Three — The World. Phase 2 will populate full prose.
---

<section class="world section-y gutter-x">
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="meta" data-reveal>The World</p>
    <h2 class="display-md title" data-reveal>
      There is a world most people <em>have never seen.</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p class="lede">
        It moves in a circle. Wellington in winter. Aachen in summer. The
        Hamptons in late August. Geneva by Christmas. The same eighty or so
        faces — the riders, the owners, the grooms, the families — show up at
        each stop, set up their barns, compete for millions, and leave for the
        next city. They live their entire lives inside this orbit. They call it
        the circuit.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="pull" data-reveal>
      <blockquote class="display-md pull__quote">
        The horse is the only Olympic athlete that doesn't know it's competing.
        That, more than anything, is what makes this sport <em>cinema.</em>
      </blockquote>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .world {
    background: var(--color-paper-warm);
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }
  .title em {
    color: var(--color-bay);
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 65ch;
  }
  .pull {
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .pull__quote {
    font-style: italic;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 60, "SOFT" 50, "WONK" 1;
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.875rem);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    max-width: 50ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .pull__quote em {
    color: var(--color-bay);
  }
</style>
